        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function is responsible for cleaning up memory that was dynamically allocated during the lifetime of an instance of this class. It deletes four arrays (QuadVertexBufferBase, CircleVertexBufferBase, LineVertexBufferBase, TextVertexBufferBase) and clears a vector (TileVertexBufferBases).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>void</para>
</simplesect>
Destructor for the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_open_g_l_pipeline" kindref="compound">OpenGLPipeline</ref> class. It is responsible for freeing up memory that was allocated dynamically during its lifetime.</para>
<para>This destructor deletes four arrays (QuadVertexBufferBase, CircleVertexBufferBase, LineVertexBufferBase and TextVertexBufferBase) which were previously allocated using new[]. Additionally, it clears the TileVertexBufferBases vector to free up memory. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
